    "title": "Rare finds. Real street.",
    "content": "<section class=\"hero\"><div class=\"hero-meta\"><span>INDEPENDENT STYLE. NO REPEATS.</span><span>EST. IN THE STREETS / VOL. 001</span></div><div class=\"hero-title\"><h1>RARE FINDS.<br><span>REAL STREET.</span></h1><div class=\"orbit\">✳<small>OUT OF THE ORDINARY<br>INTO YOUR ROTATION</small></div></div><div class=\"collage\"><div class=\"gridlines\"></div><div class=\"huge-number\">11</div><div class=\"sidecode\">ARCHIVE_001 / DO NOT DUPLICATE / ORIGINAL FREQUENCY</div><figure class=\"photo one\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523398002811-999ca8dec234?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85\" alt=\"White graphic T-shirt photographed on a hanger\"><figcaption>FILE 001 / GRAPHIC CULTURE</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"photo two\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542272604-787c3835535d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=650&q=85\" alt=\"Blue denim jeans with visible fabric detail\"><figcaption>FILE 002 / DENIM DNA</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sticker\">GOOD<br>FINDS.<br><span>BAD HABITS.</span></div><div class=\"chrome-star\">✦</div><div class=\"stamp\">11<br><small>STREET APPROVED</small></div><span class=\"coordinate\">11° STREET / EVERYWHERE</span></div><div class=\"hero-bottom\"><p>For the ones who dig deeper.<br>Clothes with character. A rotation with a point of view.</p><div class=\"ctas\"><a class=\"button blue\" href=\"shop.html\">SHOP THE DROP <span>↗</span></a><a class=\"button outline\" href=\"shop.html\">EXPLORE THE ARCHIVE <span>↘</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"drop section\" id=\"drop\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">[ 01 / THE ROTATION ] <span>YOUR NEXT FAVORITE IS IN HERE.</span></div><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2>LATEST DROP<span class=\"pink\">✳</span></h2><p>Old-school soul. New rotation.<br>Explore the concept collection.</p></div><div class=\"demo-note\">CONCEPT STORE / Illustrative products, photos and prices. Inventory is not yet live.</div><div id=\"products\" class=\"products\"></div><p id=\"empty\" hidden>No pieces match this combination. Try another filter.</p><a class=\"button blue page-shop-link\" href=\"shop.html\">VIEW ALL PIECES</a></section><section id=\"story\" class=\"story section\"><div class=\"story-bottom\"><span class=\"mini-logo\">11st®</span><p>11street is a home for people who see more than clothes. For the archive diggers, the tag readers, the ones building a collection that looks like nobody else's. Find your piece. Wear your story.</p></div></section>",
